","lemma":"전문가","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"상담이라도","meaning":"咨询","explanation":"상담：咨询；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라도：表示让步或假定：“即使是、就算是”。","readings":[{"term":"상담","audio":"/audio/22a7c006cd3331bca632.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16454","senseId":"1","lemma":"상담","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"받는","meaning":"接受，遭受，经受，承蒙","explanation":"받다：接受，遭受，经受，承蒙；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"받다","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66636","senseId":"3","lemma":"받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"게","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어때요?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"4da9a75910ede3ad","term":"교육","zh":"教育，培训","audio":"/audio/4da9a75910ede3adef01.mp3","entryId":"55289","definition":"为了培养个人能力，教授知识、教养和技术等。","pronunciation":["교ː육"]},{"id":"3e29e4abab7f1f46","term":"전문가","zh":"专家","audio":"/audio/3e29e4abab7f1f4686d9.mp3","entryId":"70833","definition":"某个领域中拥有许多知识、经验和技术的人。","pronunciation":["전문가"]},{"id":"22a7c006cd3331bc","term":"상담","zh":"咨询","audio":"/audio/22a7c006cd3331bca632.mp3","entryId":"16454","definition":"为解决某个问题而互相交谈。","pronunciation":["상담"]},{"id":"5af01487318c0c57","term":"받다","zh":"接受，遭受，经受，承蒙","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3","entryId":"66636","definition":"受到他人行为、心理作用等的影响。","pronunciation":["받따"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":